  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Native TokenVector language (tkv) release. Features 100% pure TokenVector tokenization engine: BPE Greedy & Subword Tokenizer, WordPiece (BERT-compatible), Unigram Viterbi, Streaming Incremental Decoder, Modern Chat Templates (ChatML & LLaMA-3), Cross-Encoder Sequence Pair Processor, BM25 Sparse Vectorizer & Ranking, MinHash LSH, and Corpus BPE Trainer. Official logo and documentation integration.",
